      <h2 style={{ position: "relative", margin: "0", maxWidth: "940px", fontFamily: "'Poppins', sans-serif", fontWeight: "800", fontSize: "clamp(34px, 4.2vw, 58px)", lineHeight: "1.06", letterSpacing: "-0.035em" }}>Not every lead is a patient. We check{" "}<span style={{ color: "var(--soft)" }}>four things</span>{" "}before anyone reaches your calendar.</h2>
