      <h2 style={{ margin: "0", maxWidth: "820px", fontFamily: "'Poppins', sans-serif", fontWeight: "800", fontSize: "clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 60px)", lineHeight: "1.05", letterSpacing: "-0.035em" }}>We fix the foundation before we spend your money.</h2>
