      <li style={{ display: "flex", gap: "12px" }}><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B42318" strokeWidth="2.2" strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style={{ flex: "none" }}><path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path></svg>No system to answer and follow up with enquiries</li>
